# Captured over RF from a physical EV1 2K card with a Proxmark3. The card was
# formatted under its all-zero test key before this session. The version bytes,
# directory responses, file settings, and error statuses below are measurements.
# Free-memory accounting is chip-specific and is compared with a tolerance.
name: physical EV1 2K directory and five file types
case-id: hardware-genuine-ev1-2k-directory
origin: physical-card
source: Proxmark3 RF capture, physical EV1 2K
feature-version: 5
requires: ev1,backup-files,record-files
uid: 043793CA677680
picc-generation: EV1
picc-storage: 2048
picc-key-settings-1: 0F
picc-key-settings-2: 01
picc-auth-mode: D40
picc-key-len: 16
picc-hardware-version: 04010101001605
picc-software-version: 04010101041605

